; Tabitha, sketch H "Vendetta Tango": E minor, 120 bpm. A cold tango: a habanera bass, a low clarinet sneering down a chromatic line, offbeat string stabs, a low horn and rim clicks, timpani on the downbeat. Elegant and vengeful. Original notes, AW2 voices, no rom lines.
